SOP: Create AWX Workflow Template for Windows Server Auto-Healing
Objective
When a Windows Server is detected as down:
1.	Run Job Template 1 - Device Health Check
2.	If health check fails, run Job Template 2 - AWS Recovery
3.	Validate recovery
4.	Return results to ServiceNow

Architecture

Workflow Template
│
├── Job Template 1
│     Device Health Check
│
└── Job Template 2
      AWS Windows Recovery

Execution Condition:

Health Check Failed
        ↓
AWS Recovery Runs


